<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Wave Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Wave rents at a verified 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND per month in Hanoi, the lowest monthly bracket in the fleet. For expats, students, remote workers and long-stay visitors, this is the number that turns a month of city riding into a minor budget line. This guide plans the monthly rental honestly: what the range means, what it buys, and how it compares with the weekly and daily rates.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price range and why it is a range, the per-day arithmetic that makes the month unbeatable, budgeting a month of riding, the crossovers against the 700,000 VND weekly rate, the questions that make a month-long rental run cleanly, and the honest limits of what a fixed price can tell you. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
